{"id":"stol_","lemma":"столь","pos":"adv","rank":873,"glosses":["so, such"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4f/Ru-%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Мы не столь уверены.","en":"We're not so sure.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"not"},null,null]},{"text":"Это, наверное, не столь важно.","en":"It's probably not all that important.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"probably, most likely"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"importantly"}]},{"text":"Я не могу говорить столь быстро.","en":"I can't speak that fast.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to speak, to talk"},null,{"g":"fast, quickly, rapidly"}]},{"text":"Не будь столь глупым.","en":"Don't be so stupid.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},null,null]},{"text":"Это не столь очевидно.","en":"It's not that obvious.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"apparently, obviously"}]}]}